{'symbol': 'OXY', 'date': '2019-11-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'OCCIDENTAL PETROLEUM CORPORATION DECLARES A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 15, 2020', 'text': 'OCCIDENTAL PETROLEUM CORPORATION SAID THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.79 PER SHARE ON COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON JANUARY 15, 2020, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF DECEMBER 10, 2019.'}